WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:02.590
I found it! Over there!

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.370
Hoi! Joso!

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:05.900
Ketsu!

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.160
What were you thinking?!

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.340
You'll need extra lives if
you keep fighting like that...

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.370
Yoshi, you've got to stay quick
during a challenge!

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:18.010
Hey, Tokine, are you okay?

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.580
High school student Yukimura Tokine and
junior high student Sumimura Yoshimori

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.480
are ordinary students by day.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:29.630
But at night, their mission is to
protect the Karasumori Site,

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.750
where the school now stands.
From the Ayakashi.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.660
I will become stronger!

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:39.460
I never want to see her hurt again!

00:00:54.980 --> 00:01:00.260
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.120
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:07.330
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.230
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.670
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:17.070
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:20.610
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:23.950
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:29.610
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.120
Sha la la la la...

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:40.530
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:42.500
(Secret romance)

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.700
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.470
(A strange distance)

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:56.310
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:57.380
Yeah

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.850
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:04.450
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:09.790
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.320
All right! Let's do this!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.380
Hoi! Joso!

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.360
Ketsu!

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.720
All right. 9.10 seconds from
formation to stabilization.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.630
That's average.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:54.120
Okay, next!

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:54.960
Ketsu!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:57.730
Kai!

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:15.910
Crap! It didn't even last ten seconds...

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:19.390
But I have to improve my strength...

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:23.300
If I have to fight one
that's really powerful I'm dead.

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:27.260
It seems you're training
diligently for once.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.970
I'm impressed...

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.730
But you still have much to work on!

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:35.880
What?! I'm trying my best here!

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:37.400
And you're still going to put me down?

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:38.940
It's not that.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:44.450
By the time I was your age, I'd already
split two of those training boulders.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.880
You split the boulder?!

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:51.490
I simply mean that I'd trained
until I was able to do that.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.820
H-He split this boulder?!

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:55.630
Just kidding!

00:03:55.860 --> 00:04:01.860
That boulder looks like an ordinary rock
but it actually has a core made of iron.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.160
There's no way it can be split!

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.510
Sounds like fun.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:07.170
Hm?

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.940
Then I'll crack this rock in one week.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.840
And two more in one month!
How does that sound?!

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.710
That's three rocks!
Then you can't say anything!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.750
Well, I admire your enthusiasm.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.510
Good luck to you!

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:24.480
Oh. And Yoshimori...

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:29.320
Next time, put up a Kekkai
for sound proofing.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.230
You'll bother the neighbors.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.900
But that just makes it tougher on me.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.930
You should at least
be able to do that!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:40.340
Well normally
that shouldn't be necessary.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:50.350
Ten sets per day just isn't enough...

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.010
but I still have other stuff
to do in my routine.

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:59.390
There aren't many Casters that can
pick up that boulder with so much ease.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.250
Hmm...

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:09.660
Mmm, what a refreshing night!

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.680
I'd love to go out early for a walk
on a night like this.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:18.580
Let's see... Where's Yoshimori?

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:19.610
Hm?

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:24.220
Oh look. Why is there a light coming
from the dojo at this hour?

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:33.260
Ready!

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:36.160
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.200
Oh wow. Not good at all.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:42.600
What is this?

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.440
You're off center and it's too big.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:51.710
Besides, Kekkai have many kinds of uses.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.550
There's much more to it than
simply surrounding something.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:06:00.810
At this rate, you'll never catch up to
that Yukimura girl in technique.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:07.060
I know... I don't intend to
stay like this forever.

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:10.730
I don't want to have
regrets ever again.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:15.020
I'll practice as much as I have to
so I can become stronger.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:19.200
I know how much Tokine trains
just by looking at her.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:23.210
I don't know how much
I have to do. But...

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.540
Uh-huh... That's quite admirable of you.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.970
In that case.
Let me tell you something.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:34.010
Unlike you, that girl knows
what her limits are.

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:38.390
But you know...
you have no need for that!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:50.910
Crap... Come to think of it,

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.740
I got too focused on training
and forgot to take a nap.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.070
You look sleepy.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.070
I always look like this.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.840
Oh, you poor thing...

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:04.620
I can't see myself losing
to someone with that kind of face.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:07.490
Just keep saying that!

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.760
Once I start getting results from
my training, it'll be different!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.160
Just you wait! You'll pay for this!

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:23.230
Is that what you meant
by "paying for this"?

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:26.540
Curse you you illegally parked car!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:29.840
I'll eliminate you! I'll erase you!
I'll destroy you!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:33.710
There it is. Yoshimori!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:38.080
That's it!

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.820
All right! I'll take care of
tonight's target right away!

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:45.520
Hey, wait!

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.160
Yoshimori!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:48.860
Ohhh...

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.630
You really need to start
watching your step.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.060
Which way did it go?

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.440
I think it's in this direction, honey.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:06.170
Bastard!

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.010
I won't let you get away,
you coward!

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:13.450
Crap! How could I fall for
such a stupid trap!

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:17.050
I don't think that was
supposed to be a trap.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.320
I'll definitely be the one
to bring it down!

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:20.690
I said wait!

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:22.890
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.260
It's really quick, the little coward!

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:31.670
Besides the Kekkai have
many kinds of uses.

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:34.270
There's much more to it than
just surrounding something.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.370
I get it! I should put up
a trap of my own!

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:41.780
Ketsu!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.190
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:02.430
Ice shards... They're sharp
but they don't seem that powerful.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:08.840
What's that?

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:15.680
It's time to show off
the results from my strength training.

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:17.810
This is...

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:19.580
bad!

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:35.760
Wha-? I-It tore a hole in my Kekkai!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.980
It tore a hole in my Kekkai!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.480
It's powerful enough to tear
through my Kekkai...

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:54.250
and its aim is really accurate too.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.790
It aimed straight for my head.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:02.400
I'm not going to take this sitting down!

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:07.030
It ran away! Wait!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:13.600
I got caught off guard but I don't believe
it was more powerful than my Kekkai...

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:16.100
I'll have my revenge and
pay you back double!

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.250
An Ayakashi that uses ice...

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.820
If that's so and it's going
in this direction...

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:27.620
This is bad!

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.690
What's wrong, honey?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:40.860
The best view of the path that
Yoshimori will chase it to...

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:45.030
It can only be there!

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:47.200
I said wait!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:51.940
Ketsu!

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:58.280
What?! Tokine?!
Wow... Where did she aim from?!

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.020
Whoa! It ran away again!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.160
No good, huh?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.260
I wanted to stop it before
it ran to a troublesome place.

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:14.130
Wait!

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:16.030
Hey!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.470
Huh? Huh?!

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:28.940
Whoa...

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.450
The pool turned into
an ice skating rink.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:36.190
What are you going to do?
That thing is underneath the ice.

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.360
I should just engulf the entire pool!

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.120
What?

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.520
It might be difficult, but I can do it.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:46.230
But if you fail, you just end up
wasting a lot of strength.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.970
Madarao! Tell me its position!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:51.570
I don't care if I have
to rely on luck!

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:52.840
I'm going to engulf it by force!

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:54.540
Oh fine.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:55.770
Oh... Whoa!

00:11:56.340 --> 00:12:01.010
It's so cold... Seems like it
set up another dirty trap!

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:03.280
Are you sure it's a trap?

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:08.950
Why you... There you are!

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:10.720
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:14.520
Whoa. Double the return?!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:18.230
I get it. It's the kind that
hits back even harder.

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:22.460
Whoop!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.270
What are you doing?

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:27.560
I know now!

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:28.640
Know what?

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.870
How to lure it out.

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:33.210
I just need to make it mad!

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:36.850
It's simple-minded. Always tries
to get even when it's attacked!

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:40.690
So you're saying that Ayakashi
is just like you.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:41.750
Shut up!

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:45.280
Come, you little coward!
Get out here!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.820
Are you scared of me?!

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:52.590
Come on! Take the bait.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:57.510
Ketsu! Metsu! Ketsu! Metsu!
Ketsu! Metsu! Ketsu! Metsu!

00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:00.000
He's wasting his strength again.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:06.200
Does he even understand what it means
to have strength to waste?

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.050
I better get rid of the target fast.

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:14.920
Its power is growing by the second
and this chill...

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:17.210
It's slowing down our movements.

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:23.060
Metsu! Ketsu! Metsu! Ketsu!

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.760
Even when we engulf it, it escapes.

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:27.790
That means I have to weaken it first!

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:34.770
That should do it.

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.610
There we go.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.360
Here it comes. Yoshimori!

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.530
Awesome!

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.970
You'll have to do better
than that to hit me.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:18.180
Come on! I'll stop it this time!

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.650
Yes! A hit.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.270
What?

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:47.640
Oh no!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:16.700
Huh?

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.710
I'll stop it no matter what!

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:32.220
Look at it build that huge thing.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:36.960
Oh? A double Kekkai?

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.130
Yoshi seems to be
pushing himself really hard.

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:42.860
It doesn't end there.
He's a lot stronger than you think.

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.010
The appearance of his Kekkai
might not look very good, but...

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:48.640
I'll protect Tokine!

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.310
He has so much power.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:00.990
What?!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:12.000
C-Crap.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:16.430
How many Kekkai do I have
to put up to block his ice shot?!

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:26.570
Why, you little! I'll just put up
even more Kekkai!

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:29.680
Wait.

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:33.610
You can't win at this rate.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:36.190
Tokine...

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:38.830
Just trying to add more power
isn't always the answer.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:44.230
Listen. Yoshimori...
Match your breaths with mine.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:51.200
You don't have to strain your power.
Just concentrate.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:53.170
Stay calm.

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:55.970
We have to time it well.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:16:59.810
Tokine...

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:06.510
That's right...
I swore to myself ever since that day!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:11.660
I never want to see Tokine hurt again!

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:16.020
Doesn't matter when
or against whoever!

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:19.160
I'll do something about it!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:25.730
That's what I swore to myself!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.650
Here it comes.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.730
We can do it!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.130
Now!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.240
What? It bounced off?!

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:25.830
Put me down.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:28.230
I can walk on my own!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.270
No!

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.830
You might have frostbite!

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:35.030
What about you?
You're drenched in water and ice.

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:37.100
I'm fine.

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:38.640
Then I'm fine too!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:39.340
No!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.980
You know, you're going to
catch a cold at this rate.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.410
Taking care of your own health
comes with this job.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:46.450
Shut up!

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.880
What are you so mad about?

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.050
I'm no good...

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:55.390
I always thought that the harder
the Kekkai the stronger it was.

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:58.200
Even the type of hardness
can have a lot of variation.

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:03.160
I didn't know that a Kekkai
can be used like that.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.510
I still can't...

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.980
I tried to protect her...

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:10.100
but in the end Tokine is the one
who always saves me.

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:23.080
I probably couldn't deflect
that attack with my own Kekkai.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:29.060
The power he has is something
I can never achieve...

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:32.700
If Yoshimori acquires
more techniques...

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:35.970
Then I'll...

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.000
- I want to become stronger!
- I want to become stronger!

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:07.430
I don't have the same amount
of power he does. That's why...

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:08.900
That's why...

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:12.700
I'll do everything that I'm able to do!

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:20.800
There we go.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.760
I'm so close
but something seems off.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:31.730
It's not flexible enough or...

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:34.320
is it because I'm applying
my strength the wrong way?

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:40.700
Try to remember how it felt
when it deflected that attack.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:50.470
She's probably honing
her techniques even now.

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:55.480
I'll train as much as I have to
until I catch up to her!

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:57.980
- I can't lose!
- I can't lose!

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:08.190
Looks like I made it
perfect again today.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.860
All right. The practice went well!

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.860
And now for the application!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:16.600
Let's do this!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.430
Ketsu!

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:24.440
All right! It's in the air!

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:27.380
Wow, it went up really high!

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:31.940
I-It's falling really fast!

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:37.760
Whatever... All I need to do is to catch it
with a Kekkai soft enough to cushion it.

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:44.760
No... I can't!

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:46.900
What's going on?!

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:52.470
It came from the garden...

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:55.200
That fool! What did he do now?!

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:57.610
Yoshimori!

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:06.220
Not only did he split the boulder...
he split the garden too!

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:09.260
What are you doing, you fool?!

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.660
How in the world did you
make this happen?!

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:15.180
I, uh... It's all right. I'll restore it later.

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:17.300
How many times do I have
to tell you to be careful,

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:18.890
so you don't bother the neighbors!

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:20.430
Never mind that.

00:22:20.430 --> 00:22:23.700
What's this black metallic thing
peeking out from that crack?

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:25.970
Be quiet!

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:48.560
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:55.260
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:56.840 --> 00:23:04.650
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:10.980
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:20.830
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:27.190
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:36.280
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:43.810
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:52.790
Even if we are near or far

00:23:52.790 --> 00:24:01.360
The red string connects one to another
